abstract: >-
  A ten-theory Isabelle/HOL candidate formalizing compositional cross-domain
  state preservation, deterministic selection and conditional aggregate
  progress, authenticated views, guarded model-level convergence, and a
  degree-indexed hierarchy with explicit assurance boundaries.
